    "title": "Write a practical message",
    "subtitle": "Choosing between close alternatives · 1 · preparation 2",
    "context": "Use this subset of the qualities vocabulary and constructions in a short self-contained situation, preparing for U4-36. Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to compare qualities and justify a selection with concrete evidence.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U4-36-P02-compose-produce",
